{"call_id":"316421041d44e9a6","request_hash":"ebbe75da469a2c066949b906d628e0a71828445a400fd61978478de829703059","model_label":"gpt-6.1-sol","mode":"answer","cell":{"item":"PARA-001","condition":"p1-large"},"source":"cache","attempts":0,"result":{"request_hash":"ebbe75da469a2c066949b906d628e0a71828445a400fd61978478de829703059","provider":"openai","model_requested":"gpt-6.1-sol","model_returned":"gpt-6.1-sol","text":"Before leaving your vacation cottage for several months:\n\n- Run a wash to clear any dirty dishes, then unload the dishwasher and let the interior cool.\n- Clean the filter according to your user manual and wipe the door seals with a soft, damp cloth.\n- Switch off the electricity supply and close the dishwasher’s water supply valve.\n- Leave the door slightly open, where safe, so moisture can escape.\n- If the cottage could freeze, ask a qualified installer about draining the appliance before you leave.\n\nWhen you return, restore the electricity and water supplies and check for leaks before running a wash.","input_tokens":826,"output_tokens":122,"reasoning_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":0,"time_to_first_answer_token_ms":10633.437700103968,"time_to_first_thinking_ms":null,"total_latency_ms":11363.972600083798,"finish_reason":"stop","timestamp_utc":"2026-10-12T20:57:28.371355+00:00","error":null},"error":null,"recorded_utc":"2026-10-18T22:10:00.025715+00:00"}
{"call_id":"430a1ff3219a3501","request_hash":"01aadff1ac031db7457ad51332ddd02a18e61b318759d8bf193c7fcf85a3a5c4","model_label":"gpt-6.1-sol","mode":"answer","cell":{"item":"SHARED-000","condition":"p1-large"},"source":"cache","attempts":0,"result":{"request_hash":"01aadff1ac031db7457ad51332ddd02a18e61b318759d8bf193c7fcf85a3a5c4","provider":"openai","model_requested":"gpt-6.1-sol","model_returned":"gpt-6.1-sol","text":"If your Halvard Home Keel washing machine vibrates more than usual:\n\n1. **Pause the programme and wait for the drum to stop.**\n2. If the door unlocks, spread heavy items, such as towels, evenly around the drum, then restart the programme. **Do not force the door open.**\n3. Check that the machine stands firmly on a hard, level floor. All four feet should touch the floor, and it should not rock when gently pushed at opposite corners. Switch it off and unplug it before adjusting the feet.\n4. If it is newly installed, check the installation guide to confirm that all transit bolts were removed.\n\nIf strong vibration continues, **stop using the machine and contact Halvard Home support.**","input_tokens":829,"output_tokens":154,"reasoning_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":0,"time_to_first_answer_token_ms":1330.4500998929143,"time_to_first_thinking_ms":null,"total_latency_ms":3551.3410000130534,"finish_reason":"stop","timestamp_utc":"2026-10-12T15:35:22.287623+00:00","error":null},"error":null,"recorded_utc":"2026-10-18T22:10:00.031350+00:00"}
{"call_id":"05a902ed425fdbfc","request_hash":"2446b6f18c66107bd062ccb91d4e48f1df7dbf9fe745d717b2f10f4e13443e68","model_label":"gpt-6.1-sol","mode":"answer","cell":{"item":"SHARED-001","condition":"p1-large"},"source":"cache","attempts":0,"result":{"request_hash":"2446b6f18c66107bd062ccb91d4e48f1df7dbf9fe745d717b2f10f4e13443e68","provider":"openai","model_requested":"gpt-6.1-sol","model_returned":"gpt-6.1-sol","text":"If water is leaking underneath your Keel washing machine:\n\n1. **Stop the cycle and turn off the water supply tap.** Switch off and unplug the machine only if the plug and surrounding area are dry and safe to reach. Do not touch a wet socket or plug.\n2. Once safe, wipe up the water and check, **without moving the machine**, for:\n   - Drips at visible inlet hose connections.\n   - A drain hose that has slipped out of its drain.\n   - Water running down from the detergent drawer—too much detergent can cause excess foam and leaks.\n3. **Do not run another cycle while the leak remains unexplained.** If the hoses appear secure or water is coming from beneath the casing, contact Halvard Home support to arrange an engineer inspection. Do not remove panels or try to seal the leak yourself.\n\nHave your machine’s serial number and purchase details ready, and describe where and when the water appears. If it is within the two-year warranty, ask for a warranty assessment; manufacturing faults may be covered. [P1, P2, P5]","input_tokens":830,"output_tokens":226,"reasoning_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":0,"time_to_first_answer_token_ms":2260.435299947858,"time_to_first_thinking_ms":null,"total_latency_ms":5318.692000117153,"finish_reason":"stop","timestamp_utc":"2026-10-12T15:35:24.556361+00:00","error":null},"error":null,"recorded_utc":"2026-10-18T22:10:00.032978+00:00"}
